Relighting demo scene (buttons-demo.ply)

What it is: a slimmed copy of Buttons.ply (a 3D Gaussian Splatting capture of a lab room with a
mobile equipment cart), made by tools/slim_ply.py: 196,410 of the original 249,973 splats, with
the stored normals and the higher-order spherical-harmonic terms removed, and with a person who
walked into the capture cropped out (a box of 6,522 splats), 11.0 MB.

