Regenerate: git lfs pull && python tools/slim_ply.py Buttons.ply demo/buttons-demo.ply \
  --target-mb 11 --crop=-5.8,-3.0,-1.5,1.5,-2.8,1.0
(the box is in the file's own coordinates, xmin,xmax,ymin,ymax,zmin,zmax; the output is
deterministic).
